{
  "_readme": "Manual mapping of every ESPN team/owner record (2009-present) to a canonical owner. Hand-derived from data/raw/{year}/mTeam.json's `members[]` (firstName/lastName) and `teams[].owners[]`/`primaryOwner`. Join key is first+last name, case-insensitive, per league convention (context/features/phase-2-normalization-spec.md); `name_variants` covers cases where ESPN's own member record for a person changed over time (e.g. a nickname used before they set a real name). ESPN member IDs (SWIDs) are deliberately NOT stored here -- data/README.md and context/ai-interaction.md treat them as credential-like, so identity resolution reads them transiently from data/raw/ at parse time (scripts/lib/mapping.py) rather than duplicating them into this committed file. No unmapped or ambiguous team-seasons as of this pass -- every 2009-2025 season resolved cleanly from ESPN's own member records, so no commissioner input was needed (see context/research/data-audit-findings.md for the underlying data quality). Precious, hand-edited: do not regenerate wholesale without preserving the _note fields.",
